        <div class="container-large">
          <div class="padding-vertical padding-xxlarge">
            <div class="benefices_component">
              <h2 class="heading-large">A <span class="highlight-orange">connected kiosk </span><br>for your company restaurant</h2>
              <div class="w-layout-grid benefices_content-wrapper">
                <div id="w-node-_2e0db9ab-f3b9-ffdc-7d6d-88849ef54026-6643cbb0" class="center">
                  <div class="icon-shape-small">👥</div>
                  <h3 class="title-4"><strong>+ 25% increase</strong><br></h3>
                  <div class="text-gray-1">A catering solution with little handling required for a good meal!<br></div>
                </div>
                <div id="w-node-_2e0db9ab-f3b9-ffdc-7d6d-88849ef5402f-6643cbb0" class="center">
                  <div class="icon-shape-small">🛍️</div>
                  <h3 class="title-4"><strong>Less waiting</strong></h3>
                  <div class="text-gray-1">More fluidity thanks to a multiplication of control points <br></div>
                </div>
                <div id="w-node-_2e0db9ab-f3b9-ffdc-7d6d-88849ef54038-6643cbb0" class="center">
                  <div class="icon-shape-small">🌟</div>
                  <h3 class="title-4"><strong>4 times less expensive</strong></h3>
                  <div class="text-gray-1">Compared to other kiosk solutions on the market. <br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a href="#contact" class="button-icon-2 w-inline-block">
                <div>Get my quote</div>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
      <div data-poster-url="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6144e950589804576d0974b3/6145dde4cec734213932b9ef_frigo connecté-poster-00001.jpg" data-video-urls="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6144e950589804576d0974b3/6145dde4cec734213932b9ef_frigo connecté-transcode.mp4,https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6144e950589804576d0974b3/6145dde4cec734213932b9ef_frigo connecté-transcode.webm" data-autoplay="true" data-loop="true" data-wf-ignore="true" data-beta-bgvideo-upgrade="false" class="background-video w-background-video w-background-video-atom">
        <video id="2e0db9ab-f3b9-ffdc-7d6d-88849ef5404b-video" autoplay loop style="background-image:url(&quot;https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6144e950589804576d0974b3/6145dde4cec734213932b9ef_frigo connecté-poster-00001.jpg&quot;)" muted playsinline data-wf-ignore="true" data-object-fit="cover"><source src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6144e950589804576d0974b3/6145dde4cec734213932b9ef_frigo connecté-transcode.mp4" data-wf-ignore="true"><source src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6144e950589804576d0974b3/6145dde4cec734213932b9ef_frigo connecté-transcode.webm" data-wf-ignore="true"></video>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="paiement" class="section container">
      <div class="page-padding">
        <div class="container-large">
          <div class="w-layout-grid feature-2-column">
            <div id="w-node-e9c1509b-6213-7e17-5d86-40d8bd0a1273-6643cbb0" class="card-1-large bg-gray-6 fade-in-1st">
              <p class="caption text-orange fade-in-1st">SIMPLIFIED PAYMENT</p>
              <div class="w-layout-grid _2-column">
                <div id="w-node-e9c1509b-6213-7e17-5d86-40d8bd0a1275-6643cbb0">
                  <div class="margin-bottom margin-medium">
                    <h2 class="title-4 fade-in-1st">Offer a payment method directly from the order terminal.<br></h2>
                    <p class="fade-in-1st">Reduce your restaurant's cashier traffic by giving your customers the opportunity to pay for their orders independently, from the kiosks at no extra cost and 100% secure. All payment options are accepted.</p>
                    <img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc59224c19fc3c_Web_logoo-1-removebg-preview.webp" loading="lazy" width="454" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 181px, (max-width: 1919px) 24vw, 454px" alt="logo payment" srcset="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc59224c19fc3c_Web_logoo-1-removebg-preview-p-500.png 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc59224c19fc3c_Web_logoo-1-removebg-preview.webp 744w" class="image-7">
                  </div>
                  <a href="#contact" class="button-icon-2 w-inline-block">
                    <div>Get my quote</div>
                  </a>
                </div>
                <div id="w-node-e9c1509b-6213-7e17-5d86-40d8bd0a127e-6643cbb0" class="feature-image-middle"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5958da19fc56_Frame%2010.webp" sizes="100vw" srcset="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5958da19fc56_Frame%252010-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5958da19fc56_Frame%2010.webp 800w" alt="self-ordering kiosk with TPE" class="radius-image fade-in-2nd"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-e9c1509b-6213-7e17-5d86-40d8bd0a1280-6643cbb0" class="card-1-large bg-gray-6 v-space fade-in-1st">
              <div>
                <div class="margin-bottom margin-medium">
                  <p class="caption text-orange fade-in-1st">Increase tickets&nbsp;number </p>
                  <h2 class="title-4 fade-in-1st">Increase traffic without clogging up your restaurant with the order terminal.</h2>
