              <div>
                <div class="margin-bottom margin-medium">
                  <p class="caption text-orange fade-in-2nd">Ergonomics and customization</p>
                  <h2 class="title-4 fade-in-2nd">The kiosks that adapts to the layout of your fast food restaurant.</h2>
                  <p class="no-bottom-margin fade-in-2nd">The touch terminal integrates into your operational flows, but also into your space. Its compact size allows it to be installed on a stand or on your counter. A real marketing tool, you can customize its content to promote your image within the point of sale or nearby.</p>
                </div>
                <a href="#contact" class="button-icon-2 w-inline-block">
